          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem sum_odd_coefN_eq (N R : ℕ) :\n    ∑ q ∈ (Icc 1 R).filter Odd, coefN N q =\n      ∑ t ∈ (oddPrimes R).powerset.filter (fun t => ∏ p ∈ t, p ≤ R), ∏ p ∈ t, aP N p :=\n  sum_odd_sqfree_eq (aP N) R",
